From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 03 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/23] FreeChat: emergency PIN for the app lock

In the app lock settings the user can set an emergency PIN, with the
PIN's length and a different value, encrypted with the PIN's key and
removed with it. Entered to unlock, it signs out of every account and
erases this device's data at once, like a forgotten PIN but without a
prompt, and does not count as a wrong PIN.
